92%\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e774; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e1862 [party_statement; 247Wallst.com, by Gerelyn Terzo, describing NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang\\u2019s earnings-call guidance; original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:61ba718265df905f5dcc9dad 2026-08-11] NVIDIA guided Q2 revenue to about $91 billion.\\n    Quote: Q2 guidance of $91 billion, give or take.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e775; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e1866 [third_party_view; 247wallst.com (Gerelyn Terzo); original source 247wallst.com (Gerelyn Terzo) 2026-08-11; from gnews:484913e67532d3a806abf6a1 2026-08-11] The author estimates that $150 billion to $200 billion in incremental SpaceX orders could contribute to a conditional NVIDIA share-price path to $500; the passage also cites NVIDIA Q2 revenue guidance of $91 billion, up about 34% year over year.\\n    Quote: Layer even $150 billion to $200 billion in incremental SpaceX orders onto NVIDIA\\u2019s accelerating trajectory, including Q2 guidance of $91 billion, up roughly 34% year over year, and the path to a $500 share price becomes a math problem.\\n- e1868 [third_party_view; 247wallst.com (Gerelyn Terzo); original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:484913e67532d3a806abf6a1 2026-08-11] NVIDIA reported quarterly revenue of $81.61 billion, up 85.2% year over year, gross margin of 75.0%, and quarterly free cash flow of $48.55 billion.\\n    Quote: Nvidia\\u2019s revenue grew 85.2% YoY last quarter to $81.61 billion, gross margin sits at 75.0%, and free cash flow hit $48.55 billion in a single quarter.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e1330; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e1870 [fact; IBM; original source IBM and Together AI 2026-08-11; from gnews:b830d772d6e11e0ccaa0093b 2026-08-11] IBM and Together AI signed a multi-year $240 million agreement for IBM to dep