Nvidia's next-gen Vera Rubin product cycle in further cementing the company's about 70% industry share.\\n- e1891 [fact; NVIDIA; original source Alibaba ; from gnews:4d875772ec2851f5a83e10a6 2026-08-12] Alibaba released open weights for its largest open-weight model, Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B.\\n    Quote: Alibaba released the open weights for Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B (Qwen3.8-Max), its largest open-weight model\\n- e1897 [fact; CNBC; original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:a1ce80bc851752a1ba868e2d 2026-08-12] NVIDIA debuted its Nemotron 3.5 Lightning AI model this week; the model stems from the Nemotron 3 family released in December.\\n    Quote: A day later, Nvidia debuted Nemotron 3.5 Lightning . The model stems from the company's Nemotron 3 family of models released in December.\\n- e1900 [third_party_view; Fortune, reporting Goldman Sachs\\u2019 estimates; original source Goldman Sachs ; from gnews:c24969942ce8886f9557c571 2026-08-12] Goldman Sachs estimated that AI-related financing accounts for nearly one-quarter of gross U.S. investment-grade issuance and that AI investment is approaching $600 billion in 2026.\\n    Quote: Goldman Sachs estimates AI-related financing now accounts for nearly one-quarter of all gross U.S. investment-grade issuance, while AI investment itself is approaching $600 billion this year.\\n- e1904 [fact; gurufocus.com (analyst); original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:59a5ada9c38635f7607e3e4e 2026-08-12] NVIDIA reported quarterly revenue of $81 billion, up 85% year over year; the item does not identify the quarter.\\n    Quote: The company reported $81 billion in quarterly revenue, an 85% increase from a year earlier,\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e389, e1908; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e1905 [party_statement; gurufocus.com (analyst); original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:59a5ada9c38635f7607e3e4e 2026-08-12] NVIDIA forecast current-quarter revenue of $91 billion; the item does not identify the