 from nvidianews:nvidia-groq-3-lpx-now-in-full-production-with-world-class-speed-for-agentic-ai 2026-08-24] NVIDIA said Groq 3 LPX, an AI inference accelerator, is now in full production.\\n    Quote: NVIDIA today announced that NVIDIA Groq 3 LPX, the interactive AI inference accelerator, is now in full production.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e2298, e2324; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e2293 [party_statement; NVIDIA Corporation; original source Nebius ; from nvidianews:nvidia-groq-3-lpx-now-in-full-production-with-world-class-speed-for-agentic-ai 2026-08-24] Nebius plans to deploy NVIDIA Groq 3 LPX on its Nebius Token Factory production inference platform.\\n    Quote: Nebius, a leading AI cloud, plans to bring NVIDIA Groq 3 LPX to Nebius Token Factory, its production inference platform, giving developers access to extreme token generation speed for highly responsive agentic AI applications.\\n- e2295 [party_statement; NVIDIA Corporation; original source SpaceXAI 2026-08-24; from nvidianews:spacexai-adopts-nvidia-vera-cpu-to-accelerate-agentic-ai-at-massive-scale 2026-08-24] SpaceXAI is expanding its Grok AI infrastructure using NVIDIA Vera Rubin and plans to scale toward gigawatts of computing capacity.\\n    Quote: SpaceXAI is expanding its AI infrastructure for Grok with the NVIDIA Vera Rubin platform as it scales toward gigawatts of computing capacity.\\n- e2296 [party_statement; NVIDIA Corporation; original source SpaceXAI 2026-08-24; from nvidianews:spacexai-adopts-nvidia-vera-cpu-to-accelerate-agentic-ai-at-massive-scale 2026-08-24] SpaceXAI plans to base its first-generation Starmind AI satellite on an optimized NVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72 rack-scale system.\\n    Quote: SpaceXAI\\u2019s planned first-generation Starmind AI satellite will be based on the optimized NVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72 rack-scale system\\n- e2298 [party_statement; NVIDIA Corporation; original source NVIDIA 2026-08-24; from nvblo