re outlet.\\n- e2768 [third_party_view; finance.yahoo.com; original source finance.yahoo.com 2026-08-26; from gnews:30d829d46a676dddc9c5bae1 2026-08-26] Analysts expect NVIDIA networking revenue growth of roughly 134% and compute revenue growth of about 100% in the quarter about to be reported.\\n    Quote: Analysts expect networking growth of roughly 134% in the quarter about to be reported, still ahead of compute at about 100%.\\n- e2769 [third_party_view; finance.yahoo.com; original source finance.yahoo.com 2026-08-26; from gnews:30d829d46a676dddc9c5bae1 2026-08-26] Yahoo Finance estimates that networking revenue near $17 billion would represent roughly one-fifth of NVIDIA Data Center revenue in the quarter being reported.\\n    Quote: A networking figure near $17 billion would keep the business at roughly one-fifth of Data Center revenue.\\n- e2776 [fact; fool.com (analyst); original source NVIDIA 2026-08-26; from gnews:cacb2a441b87330aa1db4410 2026-08-26] NVIDIA's Data Center segment generated FY2027 Q2 revenue of $89 billion, up 117% year over year and 18% sequentially.\\n    Quote: The data center segment, which includes processors used for AI, cloud computing, high-performance computing, and (as the name implies) data centers, delivered another record-setting performance. Segment revenue surged 117% year over year and 18% sequentially to $89 billion.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e2608; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e2784 [fact; taekim.substack.com; original source NVIDIA 2026-08-26; from gnews:2d41619b8a2902306decca58 2026-08-26] NVIDIA Data Center revenue grew 117% year over year in the July quarter.\\n    Quote: Data center revenue grew even faster, up 117% versus the prior year.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e2693; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e2785 [party_statement; taekim.substack.com; original source NVIDIA 2026-08-26; from 