venue increased 138%.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e2537; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e2927 [fact; finance.yahoo.com; original source NVIDIA 2026-08-27; from gnews:68d0c633478c534c9766b00e 2026-08-27] NVIDIA reported Data Center segment sales of $89 billion for the quarter.\\n    Quote: Data Center sales hit $89 billion\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e2804; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e2946 [fact; finance.yahoo.com; original source NVIDIA 2026-08-27; from gnews:f1af0b706051f98c7b8b3394 2026-08-27] NVIDIA Data Center sales reached $89.0 billion in the second quarter, up 18% sequentially.\\n    Quote: Growth was driven by unprecedented momentum in Data Center sales, which increased 18% sequentially to reach $89.0 billion.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e2726; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e2961 [rumour; finance.yahoo.com; original source finance.yahoo.com ; from gnews:1b2be6571ab89c158fbc89cb 2026-08-27] NVIDIA is reportedly raising GPU prices by roughly 17%.\\n    Quote: NVIDIA Corporation (NASDAQ: NVDA ) is reportedly hiking prices for its GPUs by roughly 17%.\\n- e2962 [fact; finance.yahoo.com; original source CoreWeave, as reported by finance.yahoo.com ; from gnews:1b2be6571ab89c158fbc89cb 2026-08-27] CoreWeave secured more than $25 billion of additional net new customer commitments in Q3 2026.\\n    Quote: the company also managed to secure more than $25 billion of additional net new customer commitments in Q3.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e2064; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\n- e2963 [fact; finance.yahoo.com; original source CoreWeave, as reported by finance.yahoo.com ; from gnews:1b2be6571ab89c158fbc89cb 2026-08-27] CoreWeave reported an AI compute backlog exceeding $104 billion as of Q2 2026.\\n    Quote: Ne